              <span>📖</span>
              <span>Bảng Bước Nhảy /24 ➔ /30</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Magic Number</span>
          </div>

          <div class="overflow-x-auto text-xs">
            <table class="w-full border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 text-[11px] text-left">
